  "title": "Astec Enters into Definitive Agreement to Acquire CWMF Corporation",
  "summary": "Astec Industries, Inc. (NASDAQ: ASTE) (“Astec” or “Company”) today announced the signing of a definitive agreement to acquire CWMF Corporation (“CWMF”). CWMF (https://cwmfcorp.com/) is a manufacturer of portable and stationary asphalt plant equipment and parts with annual revenues of approximately $50 million. The distribution of CWMF products is primarily concentrated in the Midwest, South-Central and...",
